+F:	include/dt-bindings/power/brcm,bcm6846-pmb.h
+F:	include/dt-bindings/reset/brcm,bcm6846-pmb.h
+
 BROADCOM BDC DRIVER
 M:	Justin Chen <justin.chen@broadcom.com>
